I had created a presentation on the IB ACM to present at the OFA conference=
, but I think I was deemed too boring to actually present.  In any case, I =
completed the attached presentation for those interested in reading more ab=
out it.

Simply put, IB ACM is a daemon that takes IP addresses and returns path rec=
ords.  Its main focus is on meeting the scalability requirements of MPI app=
lications on large clusters.  Work on IB ACM is ongoing.

Enjoy!

- Sean

